   "text": "I dive deeper, it seems like a shitty idea."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.12,
   "end": 13.52,
   "text": "Well, here's what you can do."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.52,
   "end": 18.36,
   "text": "Go to site like acquire.com or trustmr.com. You're going to look through the database"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.36,
   "end": 21.92,
   "text": "of apps that are already working and making money. Like, for example, this one in the"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.92,
