   "text": "health and fitness space. It's making around 60k a month. The pick that existing idea,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.76,
   "end": 29.32,
   "text": "you're then going to research this product online. For example, look up all of the reviews"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.32,
   "end": 33.56,
   "text": "on trustpilot. So check out the ratings on their app store, both the good ones and the"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.56,
   "end": 37.68,
   "text": "bad. Then simply go to claw, share the URL of this product you want to recreate, share"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.68,
   "end": 41.64,
   "text": "the reviews with clawed, and ask clawed to highlight the pain points of missing features based"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.64,
   "end": 44.96,
   "text": "on user complaints. Then simply ask, tell me how I could make this better."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.96,
   "end": 48.76,
   "text": "And this way it's pretty easy to start a new product. You just take an existing idea,"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.76,
